{"ref":"BDB, מֵיתָר","hw":"מֵיתָר","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מֵיתָר</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. cord, string</strong> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, יֶ֫תֶר²\" href=\"/BDB,_יֶ֫תֶר²\", dir=\"rtl\">ii. יֶתֶר</a>); of tent-<em>cords</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵתָרַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.20\">Je 10:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵיתָרַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.2\">Is 54:2</a>; specif. of <em>cords</em> of tabernacle, <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵיתָרָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:40\" href=\"/Exodus.39.40\">Ex 39:40</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:26\" href=\"/Numbers.3.26\">Nu 3:26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵיתְרֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:18\" href=\"/Exodus.35.18\">Ex 35:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:37\" href=\"/Numbers.3.37\">Nu 3:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:26\" href=\"/Numbers.4.26\">4:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:32\" href=\"/Numbers.4.32\">32</a> (all P); of bow-<em>strings</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵיתָרֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:13\" href=\"/Psalms.21.13\">ψ 21:13</a>.","next":"BDB, יַתִּיר","prev":"BDB, מוֹתָר"}